{'symbol': 'WRK', 'date': '2023-01-27 10:31:00', 'title': 'WESTROCK ANNOUNCES QUARTERLY DIVIDEND OF $0.275 PER SHARE', 'text': 'ATLANTA--( BUSINESS WIRE )--WESTROCK COMPANY (NYSE: WRK) TODAY REPORTED THAT ITS BOARD OF DIRECTORS DECLARED A QUARTERLY DIVIDEND OF $0.275 PER SHARE ON ITS COMMON STOCK. THE QUARTERLY DIVIDEND OF $0.275 PER SHARE WILL BE PAID TO STOCKHOLDERS OF RECORD AS OF THE CLOSE OF BUSINESS ON FEBRUARY 10, 2023, AND WILL BE PAID ON FEBRUARY 22, 2023.'}